        difficultyReason = "Activate Gor'ashan and burst before his fourth Thundering Cacophony.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Activate Gor'ashan and burst before his fourth Thundering Cacophony.\n\n1. Select HEROIC before entering Upper Blackrock Spire. Several original Draenor mechanic achievements do not credit on Mythic. Remove reactive damage and damaging pets when waiting for mechanics.\n\n2. Deactivate all the giant rune traps that start Orebender Gor'ashan's encounter. Leave the trap nearest his access ramp until last so you can reach him quickly.\n\n3. Kill him immediately before four Thundering Cacophony casts. If the shield phase begins and damage is insufficient, deactivate the relevant conduits quickly and continue; do not simply wait through repeated casts.",
