        difficultyReason = "A legacy dungeon clear with no additional encounter condition.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A legacy dungeon clear with no additional encounter condition.\n\n1. Select Heroic dungeon difficulty before entering Upper Blackrock Spire at the marked entrance; a Normal clear does not replace the required difficulty.\n\n2. Enter Blackrock Mountain from Searing Gorge, reach the Blackrock Spire doorway and choose the Upper Blackrock Spire portal inside. Clear Gor'ashan, Kyrak, Tharbek and Ragewing, then Warlord Zaela. Let Zaela's introductory dialogue finish before attacking.\n\n3. Check the achievement after the final encounter. If combining other achievements, satisfy their conditions before killing their bosses; an immediate kill can spend that attempt.",
