        name = "Builder",
        source = "Builder",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Upgrade the complete set of building plots on the same Garrison.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Upgrade the complete set of building plots on the same Garrison.\n\n1. Develop your Town Hall until all required plot sizes are available. Fill the small, medium and large plots with buildings you intend to keep, then learn their level 2 blueprints.\n\n2. Upgrade and activate the plot buildings to level 2. For Master Builder, the target set is three small, two medium and two large buildings. Fixed Mine, Garden, Fishing Shack and Menagerie are separate from those plot counts.\n\n3. Check each plot-size criterion. If Builder remains short despite two small buildings, fill and upgrade the remaining small plot: a current reply confirms this resolved its incomplete tracker. Click each finished construction sign.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {
