        difficultyReason = "Unlock the four preset buildings through their introductions.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Unlock the four preset buildings through their introductions.\n\n1. Upgrade your Garrison to level 2 and complete the Mine introduction from the miner outside its fixed entrance. The Mine is a preset structure and does not consume a small plot.\n\n2. Take the Herb Garden and Fishing Shack opening quests when offered at their fixed sites and finish the introductory gathering/fishing tasks. No Mining or Herbalism profession is required for the corresponding Garrison building.\n\n3. For the Menagerie, speak to the pet-battle NPC and finish Pets Versus Pests by defeating the three Garrison pests. Bring an appropriate level-25 pet team. Check all four building criteria rather than upgrading only ordinary plot structures.",
