    [9105] = {
        achievementId = 9105,
        name = "Tour of Duty",
        source = "Tour of Duty",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Win four different Classic Ashran side events while present in their areas.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Win four different Classic Ashran side events while present in their areas.\n\n1. Open the PvP queue and enter Ashran. Prefer Brawl: Classic Ashran when its rotation is active for the original events, captains and rare spawns; walking into outdoor Ashran is not equivalent to entering the battleground. Check the in-game brawl calendar rather than an old posted date.\n\n2. Watch the announcement for Molten Quarry, Ashmaul Burial Grounds, Brute's Rise or Amphitheater of Annihilation. Travel to the announced event and complete its displayed objective with your faction before the event ends.\n\n3. At Ashmaul Burial Grounds, participate in the spirit-capture event and stand on DRY LAND inside its area when it completes. A 2025 report describes standing in the water missing credit despite a win, then succeeding on land.\n\n4. Win all four event types and check each criterion. Events from the ordinary streamlined battleground do not always reproduce the Classic side activities, which is why the brawl is the recommended route.",
