        name = "Just for Me",
        source = "Just for Me",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Loot and activate an Ashran epic class book matching your class.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Loot and activate an Ashran epic class book matching your class.\n\n1. Open the PvP queue and enter Ashran. Prefer Brawl: Classic Ashran when its rotation is active for the original events, captains and rare spawns; walking into outdoor Ashran is not equivalent to entering the battleground. Check the in-game brawl calendar rather than an old posted date.\n\n2. Defeat Ashran rare elites and loot their special-item drops until you obtain an epic class book your CURRENT class can use. A book intended for another class does not satisfy the activation condition.\n\n3. Use the book while still inside Ashran and check achievement credit. Picking it up without activating it is insufficient. Older class-specific credit bugs are reported in comments, so verify the result before farming further duplicate books.",
