        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Rare mission appearances and completion timers limit progress.\n\n1. At the Garrison table, identify Rare missions by their BLUE mission name; a rare follower alone does not turn an ordinary mission into a Rare mission.\n\n2. Assign good counters, wait for the timer and claim a SUCCESSFUL result. Repeat for 1 credited Rare missions. Level 3 Inn treasure missions and eligible naval Rare missions can widen the available pool.\n\n3. Check the current account counter while using other Garrison characters. A 2025 comment reports Warband-shared progress; do not repeat the older claim that all three hundred must be on one character. Random availability can make this a long-term objective.",
