        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - One successful Patrol and one successful Treasure mission.\n\n1. Build Barracks and complete a successful spyglass-icon Patrol mission at the Town Hall table for Patrol Mission Specialist.\n\n2. Develop a level 3 Inn/Tavern and complete a roll-of-banknotes Treasure mission for Treasure Mission Specialist. Current rewards can be resources rather than historical gold.\n\n3. Check both named specialist criteria. Fifty completions of each type are separate achievements and are not required for this two-part meta.",
