        name = "Save Those Buildings!",
        source = "Save Those Buildings!",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Six separate invasion types and a strict defense/rating condition.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Six separate invasion types and a strict defense/rating condition.\n\n1. Use a level 3 Draenor Garrison. Buy an appropriate Scouting Missive for 200 Garrison Resources from Sergeant Crowler (Alliance) or Sergeant Grimjaw (Horde), complete its assault with kills and turn it in. If an invasion does not appear, repeat the corresponding assault/kills: invasion threat is not a guaranteed one-kill trigger.\n\n2. Complete all SIX factions: Botani, Goren, Iron Horde, Ogres, Shadow Council and Shadowmoon Clan. Trigger each using the appropriate assault area shown in the map choices and its individual invasion guide.\n\n3. Return to the Garrison and speak to its sergeant to start the invasion. Invite up to two helpers and have them enter the leader's Garrison first. Cover the entrances, kill attackers promptly, rescue frightened citizens, intercept saboteurs/snipers and defend buildings until the final boss and cleanup finish.\n\n4. For every faction, keep every building intact throughout the defense. Prioritize saboteurs and attackers on buildings; an excellent point score does not replace the no-building-loss condition. Repeat only the missing faction criteria.\n\n5. Bring a ranged attack for snipers on roofs, trees and outer walls. On Alliance Iron Horde invasions, clearing those snipers can release further spawns. If you own the Winter Veil Festive Outfits decoration (128668), activate it: later Retail replies report stronger guards with it enabled. This is optional assistance, not a requirement to wait for the holiday.",
