        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Visit another same-faction player's Garrison and wave.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Visit another same-faction player's Garrison and wave.\n\n1. Group with another player of your faction who has a Draenor Garrison and make that player party leader. You may be on different realms.\n\n2. Right-click YOUR OWN character portrait, choose the option to view the leader's Garrison and enter their phase. If the option is missing, check the leader and faction and switch party leadership if necessary.\n\n3. Target the host and use /wave inside their Garrison. Check credit before leaving; visiting your own phase or waving in the outdoor zone does not satisfy it.",
