        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Upgrade 1 followers' weapons AND armor to the threshold.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Upgrade 1 followers' weapons AND armor to the threshold.\n\n1. Raise the required Garrison followers to level 40. Obtain follower weapon/armor upgrades from Bunker/War Mill work orders, Salvage and missions, or buy Frozen Arms of a Hero if available on your Auction House.\n\n2. Use the upgrade items on 1 active followers on the same character until BOTH each follower's weapon and armor reach at least 625. An average item level concealing one low slot can miss credit.\n\n3. Keep the qualifying followers active together and apply one further small upgrade if the count does not refresh. These are follower power levels, not the player's post-squish equipment item level.",
