        name = "Defender of Draenor",
        source = "Defender of Draenor",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Five thousand honorable player kills in Draenor.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Five thousand honorable player kills in Draenor.\n\n1. Queue for Ashran or join eligible outdoor Draenor PvP and stay in honorable-kill range of your faction's active group.\n\n2. Earn 5,000 honorable kills, combining the grind with your active Nemesis quests and Broken Bones where applicable. Ordinary creature kills, duels and kills that grant no qualifying honor do not replace the requirement.\n\n3. Check the achievement's cumulative counter. Its monument reward can have a separate Garrison display issue; do not mistake a missing monument choice for missing honorable-kill credit.",
