        name = "Master of Apexis",
        source = "Master of Apexis",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Earn one hundred thousand Apexis Crystals cumulatively.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Earn one hundred thousand Apexis Crystals cumulatively.\n\n1. Track the achievement and collect Apexis Crystals from accepted Garrison assaults/scouting missives and Tanaan daily quests. Pick missing Securing Draenor assault areas so the same work advances both achievements.\n\n2. Build a Mage Tower/Spirit Lodge if you want an additional passive source: farm Ogre Waystones, place its work orders and collect the completed Apexis shipments. Do not confuse Garrison Resources or Blackfang Claws with Apexis Crystals.\n\n3. Earn 100,000 cumulatively. Spending crystals does not erase credited earnings; watch the live currency cap and spend before hitting it, because rewards converted into gold at the cap do not add earned crystals.\n\n4. Check achievement credit separately from its monument. Recent comments report Garrison monument-selection bugs; those reward-display problems do not make the crystal-earning achievement itself unobtainable.",
