        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Eight Heroic clears, including the reworked Skyreach.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Eight Heroic clears, including the reworked Skyreach.\n\n1. Select Heroic and complete Bloodmaul Slag Mines, Iron Docks, Auchindoun and Skyreach. Use the dropdown for each entrance and check its Heroic final-boss criterion.\n\n2. Complete Heroic Grimrail Depot, The Everbloom, Shadowmoon Burial Grounds and Upper Blackrock Spire. The latter is inside Blackrock Mountain in Eastern Kingdoms; the other seven are in Draenor.\n\n3. Check all eight Heroic achievements. This is the personal meta. A guild group, special Glory encounter conditions and retired Challenge Modes are unnecessary; old comments about guild banners describe a different guild achievement.",
