    [9396] = {
        achievementId = 9396,
        name = "Glory of the Draenor Hero",
        source = "Glory of the Draenor Hero",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Several controlled mechanics and a currently reported Croman escort bug affect the full meta.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Several controlled mechanics and a currently reported Croman escort bug affect the full meta.\n\n1. Check your existing criteria before planning a complete Heroic circuit. Current November 2026 reports say Croman disappears when freed, blocking Come With Me If You Want to Live if it is still missing. The other listed achievements can still be worked on; a completed Croman criterion is retained.\n\n2. Complete Draenor Dungeon Hero and the listed encounter achievements in Bloodmaul, Iron Docks, Auchindoun, Grimrail, Everbloom, Shadowmoon Burial Grounds and Upper Blackrock Spire. Open each individual guide BEFORE pulling its boss and use Heroic for the mechanic achievements.\n\n3. Bring a knockback class for No Ticket and a resurrection-capable participant for Leeroy. Reserve low damage for Magmolatus and Zaela, and wait for adds at Nyami, Bonemaw, Ner'zhul and Ragewing.\n\n4. The retired four Skyreach mechanic achievements and They Burn, Burn, Burn are no longer required. No Tag-backs! is also outside this meta. Check only the current required criteria; the Frostplains Battleboar reward depends on all of them, including the Croman criterion when its escort works.",
