        name = "Gorgrond Monster Hunter",
        source = "Gorgrond Monster Hunter",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Defeat eight named outdoor elites; several patrol between the marked points.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat eight named outdoor elites; several patrol between the marked points.\n\n1. Establish your Gorgrond outpost at Highpass (Alliance) or Beastwatch (Horde) if kills fail to count. Then travel around Gorgrond and kill each named elite; the trophy turn-in quests are separate from achievement kill credit.\n\n2. Kill Biolante by Iyun Weald's lake; Crater Lord Igneous in Sulfur Basin; Khargax in Mistcreep Mire; and Charl Doomwing at the Drywind Gorge rock pillars. Charl flies between three marked platforms, so search his route rather than only one point.\n\n3. Kill Roardan the Sky Terror on its Crimson Fen/Mistcreep flight route, Dessicus at Brimstone Springs, Erosian above Steamburst Cauldron, and Fungal Praetorian in Crimson Fen. Revisit missing patrols; the ordinary creatures with similar appearances do not substitute.",
