    [9432] = {
        achievementId = 9432,
        name = "Would You Like a Pamphlet?",
        source = "Would You Like a Pamphlet?",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Collect three random tome buffs inside the active assault area.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Collect three random tome buffs inside the active assault area.\n\n1. Accept Assault on Pillars of Fate from your Garrison planning table or buy its scouting missive from the Garrison quartermaster. Fly to the Shadowmoon Enclave in northeastern SPIRES OF ARAK. Keep the assault active while collecting.\n\n2. Click Hidden/Forbidden Tomes around 74.62,31.22; 74.27,27.73; 71.7,27.9; 70.51,24.15; 69.73,20.0; and 71,22.64. Each gives one of three random five-minute incantations. Keep searching until all three are active together.\n\n3. Remain within the assault boundary. The old hut at 72.76,32.49 and cave-edge locations can remove all buffs by leaving the area, so they are deliberately omitted. Do this outside the void portal; entering the void is for the other two achievements.",
