        name = "A-VOID-ance",
        source = "A-VOID-ance",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Three players must activate Kenos's summoning stones.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Three players must activate Kenos's summoning stones.\n\n1. Find an active purple void portal at the Shadowmoon Enclave in Spires of Arak and enter it. Portals are not permanently available; return later if absent rather than assuming a particular obsolete server schedule.\n\n2. Inside the void, reach the summoning circle around 70.6,24.0. Bring three participants to activate its three stones when the encounter is available.\n\n3. Kill Kenos without Void Implosion killing any Coalesced Void Fragment. Keep affected players away from fragments and dispel the debuff if needed. At high level burst Kenos before the mechanic develops, preserving the fragments. Someone else's failed explosion can invalidate the shared encounter.",
