        difficultyReason = "Personally loot 500 gathering byproducts; daily Garrison nodes provide a steady source.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Personally loot 500 gathering byproducts; daily Garrison nodes provide a steady source.\n\n1. Unlock your Garrison's Mine through its introductory quest and harvest its nodes. You do not need the gathering profession for these preset Garrison nodes.\n\n2. Loot 500 Draenic Stone. If trained in Draenor mining, also gather the relevant outdoor Draenor nodes between Garrison resets. Buying or merely holding a stack is not the stated loot requirement.\n\n3. Return daily until the achievement completes. It unlocks the level 3 building blueprint, but the blueprint vendor also requires your Garrison Town Hall to be level 3 before offering the upgrade. Spending collected byproducts does not undo already recorded looting progress.",
