        difficultyReason = "Repeatable reputation farming to Exalted; combat is simple at high level.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeatable reputation farming to Exalted; combat is simple at high level.\n\n1. Open the reputation panel and select Steamwheedle Preservation Society. Check this character's standing before beginning so you know the remaining grind and have the correct faction.\n\n2. Visit the artifact collectors at the Ruins of Na'gwa. Farm northern Nagrand creatures and ogres for Gorian Artifact Fragments and Highmaul Reliquaries, and keep named rare-beast trophies. Turn these in to the camp's collectors repeatedly; the older Steamwheedle Cartel city factions do not count as this reputation.\n\n3. Continue until the panel shows EXALTED and check the achievement. Do not confuse this with a Revered-only Pathfinder requirement. A level 3 Trading Post's Draenor reputation bonus can shorten later grinds; token prices and availability should be checked before spending badges or gold.",
