        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - One eligible Draenor faction must reach Exalted.\n\n1. Choose one available Draenor reputation. Steamwheedle Preservation Society is a repeatable neutral option: collect northern Nagrand artifacts/reliquaries and turn them in at the Ruins of Na'gwa.\n\n2. Reach Exalted with that faction. The current requirement is ONE faction, not the three in old launch comments. Tanaan factions were added as eligible in later patches; personal bodyguard friendship is a different system.\n\n3. Check the achievement, then buy the level 3 Trading Post blueprint if wanted. You still need a level 3 Garrison Town Hall and construction resources to build it.",
