        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Click the giant egg while the Darktide assault is active.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Click the giant egg while the Darktide assault is active.\n\n1. Accept Assault on Darktide Roost at your Garrison or buy and use its missive. Keep it active while travelling to the island southeast of Draenor Shadowmoon Valley.\n\n2. Fly to the highest central peak at 61.26,88.77 and click the Giant Rylak Egg. If it has recently been used, wait for the egg to respawn.\n\n3. If you cannot fly, goblins on the island can drop a Goblin Rocket Pack for the climb. The Darktide campaign is not required merely to click this egg; recent comments confirm the assault missive method.",
