    [9481] = {
        achievementId = 9481,
        name = "You Have Been Rylakinated!",
        source = "You Have Been Rylakinated!",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Vehicle access and ten correct adolescents must fit a three-minute run.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Vehicle access and ten correct adolescents must fit a three-minute run.\n\n1. At Darktide Roost, check your Garrison Campaign: Darktide Roost progression. If the unmanned machines are unusable, follow Rexxar's chain through Dirty Rats and its next assignments. The assault missive alone does not reliably replace that character prerequisite.\n\n2. Loot a Rylakinator Power Cell from Darktide Pilferers and locate an UNMANNED Rylakinator-3000 around 57.72,88.41. Scout the healthy Darkwing Adolescent targets before entering, because the three-minute timer starts immediately.\n\n3. Take control and use its flamethrower to kill ten Darkwing Adolescents within three minutes, circling the island. Injured adolescents and little whelps do not replace the required targets. If the timer expires, obtain another cell and try a better route.",
