        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Recruit 40 followers; additional Inn recruitment is weekly.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Recruit 40 followers; additional Inn recruitment is weekly.\n\n1. Complete Draenor story and follower-rescue quests and accept their follower rewards. Open the Garrison follower list to distinguish actual recruits from merely meeting an NPC.\n\n2. Build a level 2 Lunarfall Inn/Frostwall Tavern and speak to its headhunter for one new follower per weekly recruitment opportunity. Named quest/reputation recruits and weekly Inn recruits build the roster; the active mission cap is not a permanent limit on recruitment.\n\n3. Reach 40 credited recruits. If above the active cap, deactivate spare followers before sending missions. Commander is the forty-recruit achievement's name; it does not award a Commander character title.",
