        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Successfully complete 50 Treasure missions.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Successfully complete 50 Treasure missions.\n\n1. Build a level 3 Inn/Tavern to offer Treasure missions. These appear at the Town Hall command table; the building is not a separate mission interface.\n\n2. Look for the roll-of-banknotes icon beside the mission name. Modern Treasure missions can reward Garrison Resources rather than the gold shown in old guides.\n\n3. Assign counters, wait and claim 50 SUCCESSFUL matching missions. Check the live counter rather than counting every completed mission type.",
