    [9530] = {
        achievementId = 9530,
        name = "Writing in the Snow",
        source = "Writing in the Snow",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "A randomly spawned page must be found and its quest handed in.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A randomly spawned page must be found and its quest handed in.\n\n1. Turn on low-level quest tracking and search Bloodmaul Stronghold/Stonefury Cliffs in Frostfire Ridge. The Tattered Journal Page starts Writing in the Snow (35737). Search the top of the tower near 47.9,18.97 as well as the ground locations.\n\n2. Check the mapped search points for the page or its yellow quest marker. Respawns are irregular. If absent, return later; reports disagree about mandatory assault/Molthron prerequisites, so treat accepting the Stonefury missive and his local quests as troubleshooting rather than requiring Exalted reputation.\n\n3. Right-click the page, accept its quest and return it to the Alliance Garrison contact. Finding the page without the hand-in is not the full route. If you faction-changed after doing the counterpart, that character's converted quest flag can prevent a second pickup.",
