        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Gather the upgrade resources and finish the Town Hall upgrade on this character.\n\n1. Use a Horde character with its own Garrison. Open the Architect Table and select the TOWN HALL rather than an individual small, medium or large building.\n\n2. Choose the level 3 Garrison upgrade and read its current level, gold and Garrison Resource requirements. Complete the offered Bigger is Better/My Very Own Castle upgrade quest when available; the original expansion's level 92/100 numbers are obsolete after level squishes.\n\n3. Supply the displayed cost, complete the upgrade and enter the finished layout. Level 3 opens the full set of plots and is required before constructing level 3 plot buildings.",
