    [9548] = {
        achievementId = 9548,
        name = "Buried Treasures",
        source = "Buried Treasures",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Three visible objects and three random wolf-form excavations.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Three visible objects and three random wolf-form excavations.\n\n1. Take Assault on Mok'gol Watchpost or its missive and dismiss pets/bodyguards. Find Garrosh's Shackles inside the large hut at 41.65,37.56, Warsong Relics around nearby huts/trees and the Stolen Draenei Tome in one of the towers.\n\n2. Kill a Mok'gol Wolfsong after it transforms and click its dropped skull to become a spectral wolf. The skull is left on the ground, not looted directly into bags.\n\n3. In wolf form, dig dirt mounds and THEN click the object revealed on the ground. Collect Warsong Remains, Wolf Pup Remains and Gnarled Bone; results are random and can repeat.\n\n4. Use the short safe route from the hut at 44.17,34.50 to mounds at 44,34.2; 43.28,36.58; and 42.14,37.73. Clear patrols before transforming and repeat until all six objects are credited. Keep the assault available if the skull becomes unusable.",
