        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The Ring of Blood event must be active while you collect fifteen tributes.\n\n1. Visit Krud at the Ring of Blood building in northern Nagrand and start the available event. If Krud or the event is absent, revisit rather than killing the surrounding guards indiscriminately.\n\n2. Kill the participating ogres and collect fifteen tributes while the event is active. Preserve the Pit Guards: killing them can end/despawn the event before you have finished the tribute count.\n\n3. Follow the event's interactions and check the achievement after the fifteenth tribute. Ordinary ogre kills outside the active Ring of Blood event do not replace this requirement.",
