        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ten boss criteria on the same character; missing-credit reports require checking each kill.\n\n1. On the character earning the title, select Heroic dungeon difficulty and defeat all eight Draenor dungeon final bosses. Use Heroic specifically: replies report Mythic dungeon kills failing to fill this meta despite its wording.\n\n2. Select Heroic RAID difficulty and defeat Imperator Mar'gok in Highmaul and Warlord Blackhand in Blackrock Foundry. Complete prerequisite encounters to reach each finale.\n\n3. Check this character's ten criteria after each finale. Recent comments report occasional missing credit, including Zaela, so let introductory dialogue and encounter transitions finish. If a valid kill still fails, report that specific missing criterion rather than repeating unrelated bosses. The title requires personal boss criteria, not the guild meta.",
