    [9632] = {
        achievementId = 9632,
        name = "The Power Is Yours",
        source = "The Power Is Yours",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Three crystal effects must overlap on a target that survives.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Three crystal effects must overlap on a target that survives.\n\n1. Bring three players and accept Assault on the Heart of Shattrath or its missive. Search the elite CITY area, not just Shattrath Harbor. Find either three single crystals of different colors or a cluster unlocked by standing on all three nearby runes.\n\n2. Assign one different crystal to each player and click together. Each player can hold only one crystal buff; the achievement requires their three DEBUFFS to overlap on an enemy, not three player buffs on one character.\n\n3. Use a durable attackable dummy such as Sturdy Love Fool, or an elite that will survive. Remove excessive damage gear and apply all three crystal effects using appropriate abilities. Some abilities do not trigger a color: try another, then coordinate the short debuff windows.\n\n4. In 2026 reports, priest Dispel Magic triggered purple, warlock Conflagrate triggered red and druid Wrath triggered green. The single-account relog method is unreliable; three present participants avoid its timing problem.",
