        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Burn thirty papers while Heart of Shattrath is active.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Burn thirty papers while Heart of Shattrath is active.\n\n1. Accept Assault on the HEART OF SHATTRATH or its missive. The Harbor assault does not cover most of the residential-district papers.\n\n2. Follow the map's paper locations through western Shattrath. Look on walls, doorways, trees, tables and bookshelves; the little Sargerei Missives are clickable notes rather than item drops from enemies.\n\n3. Interact and finish the burn cast until thirty are credited. Recent comments report that a quick second click can queue a second credited cast, but the ordinary circuit and respawns suffice. Keep the correct assault active until finished.",
