        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Seven rares require repeated checks of the Pit and its patrol routes.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Seven rares require repeated checks of the Pit and its patrol routes.\n\n1. Travel to the Pit in northern Gorgrond. An active Assault on the Pit is useful for the area and is reported with recent successful rare camps; keep the assault available while searching.\n\n2. Defeat Maniacal Madgard, Durp the Hated, Defector Dazgo, Horgg, Morgo Kain, Inventor Blammo and Blademaster Ro'gor. Search all marked patrol positions for Horgg and Ro'gor, rather than treating the first coordinate as a fixed spawn.\n\n3. Check the achievement's missing criteria after each circuit and return for the absent rares. Current reports include long waits; clicking unrelated crystals is not established as a guaranteed spawn trigger.",
