        difficultyReason = "Find one correct attack-plan scroll at one of four elevated locations.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Find one correct attack-plan scroll at one of four elevated locations.\n\n1. Accept Assault on the Pit or its missive and search the Pit in Gorgrond. Look for Iron Horde Attack Plans, not the ordinary glowing books/missives lying around the assault area.\n\n2. Check the broken rail at 45.2,25.2, crane top at 45.8,27.2, middle tower top at 48.2,27, and crane top at 49,24. Flying can reach the elevated objects. Click the plans at whichever spawn is present.",
