        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Pass four cannon-created smoke rings during the three-minute flight window.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Pass four cannon-created smoke rings during the three-minute flight window.\n\n1. Visit the Pit and use the launch cannon near 46,31. Aim through the visible smoke rings toward the opposite platform around 46.7,22.3.\n\n2. Pass four rings within three minutes. Retail comments also describe firing the cannon once to create the smoke rings, then flying your own mount through them; target Smoke Ring if their visual effect is difficult to see and pass through the ring beneath its nameplate.\n\n3. Watch the ring counter/timer and repeat a pass if it did not register. The documented mount alternative can pass back through a ring; four separate cannons are unnecessary.",
