        name = "Picky Palate",
        source = "Picky Palate",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Keep the three distinct outdoor fruit effects active together.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Keep the three distinct outdoor fruit effects active together.\n\n1. Accept Assault on the Everbloom Wilds or its missive. Collect fruit before the assault reaches 100%, when the interactions can stop.\n\n2. Click a Lovely Coconut at 70.9,42.2, Prickly Guava at 72.21,41.53 and Gorgraberries at 73.16,37.94. These are different ground fruit objects; keep their ten-minute effects active together.\n\n3. If an object is missing, search nearby ground or the alternate fruit cluster around 59.65,33.41. Reducing Ground Clutter can make fruit easier to see. Take a fresh missive if assault completion disabled the objects.",
