        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Repeat the correct Iron Siegeworks interaction ten times during an active assault.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Repeat the correct Iron Siegeworks interaction ten times during an active assault.\n\n1. Accept Assault on the Iron Siegeworks or its scouting missive, then visit eastern Frostfire Ridge. Keep the assault active and unfinished while using its special objects.\n\n2. Search the large Siegeworks buildings for Secret Warplans, including 82.22,56.35, and interact to sabotage them. These are the usable assault plans, not decorative paperwork.\n\n3. Complete ten interactions. Recent comments describe clicking and cancelling the interaction repeatedly on the same object as giving credit; watch your actual counter, and use ten normal completed interactions across spawns if that shortcut does not register.",
