        name = "Thy Kingdom Come",
        source = "Thy Kingdom Come",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Defeat Kor'lok with your faction's group.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Defeat Kor'lok with your faction's group.\n\n1. Open the PvP queue and enter Ashran. Prefer Brawl: Classic Ashran when its rotation is active for the original events, captains and rare spawns; walking into outdoor Ashran is not equivalent to entering the battleground. Check the in-game brawl calendar rather than an old posted date.\n\n2. Go to the Seat of Kor'lok in central Ashran, around 54.7,49.3. Join your faction's attack and defeat Kor'lok for the required control/kill credit; remain in range through the result.",
