        {37168,"Leorajh, the Enlightened",p(542,55,65.3),"Enter the UPPER Apexis Chamber at 55,65.3 in Spires of Arak, not Leorajh's lower den near 55,69. Follow the cave left to Leorajh around 54.2,63.1, speak to him and accept / finish his recruitment."},
        {37141,"Talonpriest Ishaal",p(542,46.5,46.8),"Finish this character's Spires story chapters using the attached routes, then speak to Ishaal at Veil Terokk and accept / finish his recruitment. Account-wide zone-achievement credit may not satisfy the local phase, especially after a faction change."},
    }) do
